sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser (UI)
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant S as SDK Container

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over U,S: Transform Flow (beforeSend, tracesSampler, etc.)
        U->>+A: POST /api/transform<br/>{sdk, event, beforeSendCode}
        A->>A: Validate JSON syntax
        A->>A: Validate Sentry event structure
        A->>A: Check SDK registry availability
        A->>+S: POST /transform<br/>{event, beforeSendCode}
        S->>S: Parse user code (eval/exec/compile)
        S->>S: Execute with cloned event
        S-->>-A: {success, transformedEvent}
        A-->>-U: {success, original, transformed}
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over U,S: Config Analyzer Flow (introspection-first)
        U->>+A: POST /api/config/analyze<br/>{configCode, sdk}
        A->>A: Parse config (regex-based)
        A->>A: 1st pass: Lookup in JSON dictionary
        alt Unknown options exist
            A->>+S: GET /introspect (once)
            S-->>-A: {options[], sdkVersion, source}
            A->>A: 2nd pass: Check unknowns against introspection
        end
        A->>A: Check missing required options
        A->>A: Generate recommendations
        A->>A: Calculate health score (0-100)
        A-->>-U: {score, warnings, recommendations, summary}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over U,A: Query Validation Flow
        U->>+A: POST /api/sentry-query/validate<br/>{query}
        A->>A: Parse query components
        A->>A: Validate properties
        A->>A: Alias map lookup
        A->>A: Levenshtein fuzzy matching
        A-->>-U: {valid, components, suggestions}
    end
